lines=["MY transition recovery — experiment results, 2026-10-12", "", "Status: candidate INSTALLED as the normal signed iPhone13 Release on user request, 2026-10-12; launch and running process verified. Nine exact cleanup parity cases and all14packaging checks pass. Desktop and physical-phone replay experiments complete. Fresh signing remains untested. Deployment evidence: deployment/REPORT.txt.", "", "RESULT", "The final candidate reproduces the complete 16-token reference in all 24 original capture/auxiliary schedules and all 12 additional offset/frame-drop schedules. The installed-equivalent baseline reproduces none of those full sequences. These are correlated development replays of ONE known recording, not 36 independent recordings or new signer accuracy.", "", "Reference: MY FRIEND MY FRIEND MY NAME MY NAME MY FRIEND MY EAT MY FRIEND MY NAME", "", "The candidate preserves all recognized sequences in 570 cached streaming controls (including all 100 Citizen classes), 59 genuine MY/LIKE clips, 66 synthetic LIKE+successor controls, and 24 synthetic MY+successor+WRITE controls. 'Unchanged' refers to recognized gloss sequences; it does not mean every score/timestamp or every baseline result is correct.", "", "WHY IT REGRESSED", "1. The October replacements changed shared weights, parent initialization, phrase supervision and later fragment/reject objectives. Unchanged isolated MY/LIKE files did not freeze those decisions. Historical phrase MY supervision changed from 308 spans/32 videos to 224/24; eight MY NAME videos were excluded from training to enforce previously assigned validation roles. This was a leakage correction, not deletion of the source videos. Historical trainers also changed shared encoders. Earlier identical-input tests locate MY loss before variant filtering, so the HAVE geometry rule alone does not explain the regression.", "2. Short MY in a phrase reaches the recognizer in a different window than a clean isolated MY. The following FRIEND/NAME/EAT motion enters the context. The prior clean-core fit did not test this: the current head got only 24/89 exported actual MY windows right. Cutting future context helped MY but hurt genuine LIKE, ruling out a global crop change.", "3. Segmentation/commitment matters even when the classifier says MY. A larger following-sign span can absorb the short contact. Increasing MY confidence indiscriminately changed the decoding path and even introduced unrelated words on a DRINK control. True LIKE can also begin with a flat MY-looking prefix, so 'no pinch yet' is insufficient evidence for an early MY.", "4. Restoring old supervision alone is not a demonstrated cure. Six bounded restoration arms on the eight user-authorized historical sources improved the actual-window diagnostic only 24/89 to 25/89 and failed retention. The best repair instead uses actual transition inputs. This does not prove every possible full retraining or old split is useless; it rejects the tested restoration-only recipe.", "", "Historical evidence: ../sept30_fix_port_v17_20261011/REPORT.txt and ../lineage_runtime_investigation_v17_20261011/REPORT.txt. User authorization to reuse old roles supersedes their earlier training restriction; this turn's restoration recipe explicitly records that reuse. The final selected head does not use those eight restored clips.", "", "TRAINING EXPERIMENTS — 62 configurations"]
